    {
      "number": 130,
      "category": "liezhuan",
      "title": "太史公自序第七十",
      "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-130-taishigong:p055",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "衰續厥緒。佐文尊王，卒為晉輔。襄子困辱，乃禽智伯。主父生縛，餓死探爵。王遷辟淫，良將是斥。嘉鞅討周亂，作趙世家第十三。",
